WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,108 --> 00:00:04,340
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,718 --> 00:00:07,427
This is Episode 39.

3
00:00:07,656 --> 00:00:10,594
Eddie needs a toy from inside Sammy.

4
00:00:10,891 --> 00:00:12,805
But Sammy is locked.

5
00:00:13,021 --> 00:00:13,978
Oh no!

6
00:00:14,476 --> 00:00:17,186
Maya could give Eddie a name tag.

7
00:00:17,496 --> 00:00:20,542
Then Eddie could open Sammy any time.

8
00:00:20,731 --> 00:00:21,728
Even at night.

9
00:00:21,917 --> 00:00:23,871
Even when nobody is looking.

10
00:00:24,127 --> 00:00:25,799
That is too much.

11
00:00:26,095 --> 00:00:29,061
So Maya hands him a badge instead.

12
00:00:29,371 --> 00:00:30,678
Eddie clips it on.

13
00:00:30,853 --> 00:00:31,460
Click!

14
00:00:31,716 --> 00:00:33,104
Sammy opens.

15
00:00:33,414 --> 00:00:35,301
Eddie takes one toy.

16
00:00:35,598 --> 00:00:38,078
Then he hands the badge right back.

17
00:00:38,267 --> 00:00:38,860
Click!

18
00:00:39,076 --> 00:00:40,693
Sammy locks again.

19
00:00:41,043 --> 00:00:42,594
Eddie keeps nothing.

20
00:00:42,823 --> 00:00:44,885
No key is lying around.

21
00:00:45,195 --> 00:00:47,042
Borrow it for one job.

22
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,713
Give it straight back.

23
00:00:48,969 --> 00:00:51,126
That is the borrowed badge.

24
00:00:51,422 --> 00:00:53,795
Now you know IAM roles!

25
00:00:54,064 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

